Having regard to the facts and circumstances of the case, it is hereby ordered that out of total compensation amount, the amount is disbursed as follows :
(a) Petitioner No.1/Smt. Meenu (Wife of deceased) shall be entitled to share amount of Rs.12,00,000/- (Rupees Twelve Lacs only) alongwith proportionate interest;
(b) Petitioner No.2/Yash Kumar (Minor Son of deceased) shall be entitled to share amount of Rs.12,00,000/- (Rupees Twelve Lacs only) alongwith proportionate interest;
(c) Petitioner No.3/Punjab Singh (Father of deceased) shall be entitled to share amount of Rs.71,010/- (Rupees Seventy One Thousand Ten Only) alongwith proportionate interest;
(d) Petitioner No.4/Santosh (Mother of deceased) shall be entitled to share amount of Rs.12,00,000/- (Rupees Twelve Lacs only) alongwith proportionate interest;
43.

